        "laterality": null,
        "source": [
          "When the deceased was admitted to Queen Elizabeth Hospital on 25 March 1993, he was observed to have been semi-conscious. Following diagnosis, neuro and orthopaedic surgery was performed. According to the memorandum dated 30 July 1993 from Dr. Liang Chang-chung of the Department of Neurosurgery, QEH, post-operatively, the deceased had never regained consciousness and eventually died on 6 June 1993."
